Package: heraldo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kurt Sell <kurt.sell8@gmail.com>
Depends: bluez
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ksell8/heraldo
Description: BLE beacon advertiser (iBeacon, Eddystone) using BlueZ
 Self-contained build of heraldo: ships its own Python runtime and
 dbus/GLib bindings (PyInstaller), so only the BlueZ daemon is needed.
